      - Id: mod.update.rotation_over_life
        Name: 平面旋转与角速度 (Rotation Over Life)
        Description: 控制粒子初始旋转朝向与随寿命演进的持续角速度 (rad/s)
        Stage: Update
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: Rotation Over Life]\n    p.Rotation += u_RotationSpeed * dt;\n"
